| !One: freeglut's 'One' test: two windows, nested subwindows, Wimp menus on
| Select/Menu/Adjust (a menu in each window and subwindow), then game mode
| (the whole screen) at start: press Escape to leave it.
| Built unchanged from freeglut 3.8.0 (progs/demos) against riscos-mesa's
| freeglut, whose RISC OS back end uses Wimp windows, Wimp menus and native
| EGL. Text output goes to the file Output in this application.
Set One$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set One$Output /|<One$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !One needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !One needs ARMEABISupport
Run <One$Dir>.!RunImage
